
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.021709914 -0.002987207 -0.030254341) to (41.02629 40.629971 42.186254)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
